As a naive question, what would happen if we replaced the line:

  nll -= 0.5*penaltyDim*log_lambda - 0.5*GMRF(S).Quadform(smoothCoefs);

with:

  nll -= 0.5*(smoothCoefs * (S * smoothCoefs.matrix()).array()).sum();

Sincerely, Mark.

