Just to let you know there's a new feature in the upcoming TMB version (github branch 'TMB_experimental') that can reduce memory usage for models with symptoms similar to the ones described in this thread. Currently the feature has to be enabled by setting a flag:

TMB::config(tmbad.sparse_hessian_compress = 1)

which should reduce memory substantially, although at the cost of a minor slowdown.

